# DRAFT: partial fresh-process verification, not a complete M5 scenario.
settle 20
key escape
assert snap network-offline == true
omnibar actions
type Switch to session M5 seed
key enter
settle 8
act Search saved sources
type naïve — 東京 🐦
wait-research-search 600
assert snap suggestions ~ M5
capture 21_reopen_A1_search
choose-suggestion Capture: M5 A
wait-saved-reader 600
act Read document
